@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我们来从头到尾<br>整理一遍案件的经过吧。|#0101Trial13_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:凶手是在晚上8点<br>到9点之间作案的。<br>而在这段时间内<br>没有不在场证明的人是……|#0101Trial13_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR7,ArmL3,ArmR7,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:只有我……<br>对吧。|#0101Trial13_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:31,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……可是在我看来，<br>这只是讨论过程有错误<br>或者遗漏，<br>才得出了这个结果而已。|#0101Trial13_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你是凶手的话，<br>也只能这么狡辩了吧。|#0101Trial13_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR5,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可是你们没有我下手的<br>确切证据吧？<br>可你们还是怀疑我，<br>实在太没道理了。|#0101Trial13_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:34,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:证据啊～？<br>可是至今为止<br>我们该拿的都拿了，不是吗～！<br>这种讨论还有必要<br>持续下去吗～？|#0101Trial13_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,52 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可、<br>可是说不定，<br>还有尚未充分讨论过的<br>证物呢……|#0101Trial13_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:32,45 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那么我们就<br>重新讨论一下<br>留存下来了的<br>实体证据吧！|#0101Trial13_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL12
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"比如说……<br>奈叶香的发带，<br>怎么样？<br>这个的确是<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_13_01\">凶手用过的东西</link>，<br>没错吧！|#0101Trial13_Sherry002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那条发带<br>不是沾了血吗？<br>究竟是谁的血呢？|#0101Trial13_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Fearful1,ArmR3,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:有、有没可能<br>上面的血其实是<br>凶手的血！？<br>感觉是很常见的剧情欸～！|#0101Trial13_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"就算真是这样，<br>我们也没<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_13_02\">查证的办法</link>，<br>不太可能<br>成为<link=\"Objection_01_01_13_03\">证据</link>……<br>|#0101Trial13_Meruru001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"其他的话……<br>涂在房间里的<link=\"Objection_01_01_13_04\">颜料</link><br>有没有奇怪的地方呢？|#0101Trial13_Miria002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,52 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"也许<br>涂抹大量颜料的行为<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_13_05\">其实是有意义</link>的……|#0101Trial13_Miria003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,52 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL12
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:说起来，现场不是<br>有出现蝴蝶的绘画吗。|#0101Trial13_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_03,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:『吾辈可以担保<br>那和凶手无关』<br>|#0101Trial13_AnAn001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"那么，<br>那把<link=\"Objection_01_01_13_06\">扫帚</link>呢？<br>不是遗留在<br>现场附近了吗？<br>会不会<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_13_07\">留有某些痕迹</link>呢？|#0101Trial13_Margo002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:看起来<br>平平无奇的扫帚<br>会不会其实是<br>一把魔法扫帚！？|#0101Trial13_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:对对简直就是魔女——|#0101Trial13_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR13,ArmL10,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Comical_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:——才怪啦！<br>哪有那么巧的事！|#0101Trial13_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……唉。|#0101Trial13_AnAn002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……我说，<br>这讨论真的<br>有意义吗。<br>已经讨论够了吧……！|#0101Trial13_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我想……<br>有意义的。<br>我不想等投完票<br>才去后悔……<br>后悔我们<br>【其实犯了错】。|#0101Trial13_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,53 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……啧……<br>好啦，<br>继续就继续……|#0101Trial13_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,51 Roll:-4

